 recreation facility with varied indoor activity spaces.","evidence_claim":"ECU states that the Eakin Student Recreation Center has basketball courts, a climbing wall, indoor and outdoor pools, fitness areas, and an indoor track.","source_url":"https://crw.ecu.edu/facilities-services/student-recreation-center/","source_title":"Richard R. and JoAnn M. Eakin Student Recreation Center | Campus Recreation & Wellness | ECU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility use may require student eligibility and hours vary; verify Campus Recreation & Wellness access rules before arrival.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"north-recreational-complex","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"North Recreational Complex","title":"Make an outdoor plan at North Recreational Complex","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · about 10 minutes from Main Campus by car","notes":"Coordinate transportation before leaving campus, then choose a daytime activity around the multipurpose fields, water, or sand beach within posted rules.","short_summary":"An ECU recreation area with fields, water, and a sand beach.","evidence_claim":"ECU says the North Recreational Complex has eight multipurpose fields, six acres of water for boating and fishing, a sand beach, and is about a 10-minute drive from Main Campus.","source_url":"https://admissions.ecu.edu/explore/student-life/campus-recreation-wellness/","source_title":"Campus Recreation & Wellness | Undergraduate Admissions | ECU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Arrange transportation and confirm current facility access, equipment, and water-activity rules with Campus Recreation & Wellness.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"greenville-town-common","sub